{"about_the_game":"&quot;Corona Blossom&quot; is a heartwarming trilogy of visual novels featuring the &quot;e-mote&quot; system and artwork by nanaca mai!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLearn the fates of the characters you've grown to know and love in the exciting final chapter of the Corona Blossom saga!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSTORY:<br />\r\nR-ne: a cute, shapeshifting metallic lifeform who one day fell from space.<br />\r\nKeiji Osaki: a young man with a mysterious past, now working at a mech garage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter growing close through adventures and mishaps throughout the summer, the two of them made a promise: to return R-ne to her home planet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo that end, Keiji has steadily been working on a plan together with space pirate Lily, and his coworker at the garage, Kumiko.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut Ms. Kanade's big reveal has thrown a spanner in the works.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe people of Hanma Town must now do battle against a mysterious organization that's after R-ne.<br />\r\nTime is running out for Keiji and his friends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill they ever be able to return R-ne to space?<br />\r\nAnd is that really the right move?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe thrilling conclusion to R-ne's journey is finally here!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"e724031c2c17047a66f9e3df49aa1f12091a6ede.jpg","localized_name":"WE HAVE LIFTOFF","name":"WE HAVE LIFTOFF","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/562480/e724031c2c17047a66f9e3df49aa1f12091a6ede.jpg"},{"icon":"badcf981f8b5f33c80ee5a455cefcd98cf3c347a.jpg","localized_name":"WEALTH IN LOSS","name":"WEALTH IN LOSS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/562480/badcf981f8b5f33c80ee5a455cefcd98cf3c347a.jpg"},{"icon":"e2c79a273e898c94bb678195090d2db422f5899f.jpg","localized_name":"FATE'S TWISTED PATH","name":"FATE'S TWISTED PATH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/562480/e2c79a273e898c94bb6781950